        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 01, Contemporary Half-Round Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAs pleasing to the eye as it is to the hand, Fusion Hardware's Half-Round Knob will look great in any contemporary style home. Customizable, there are 3 different roses and 3 different finishes to choose from--so you can create something you will love. It is self adjusting to door thicknesses of 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches. Plus it is available in either a 2-3/8 inch backset or a 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 01 Half Round Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Solid Brass Contemporary Door Knob Fusion 01:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter:  2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Half Round Contemporary Knob, Fusion 01",
                "description": "Contemporary Half Round Knob Fusion 01 - As pleasing to the eye as it is to the hand, Fusion Hardware's Half-Round Knob will look great in any contemporary style home. Customizable, there are 3 different roses and 3 different finishes to choose from--so you can create something you will love. It is self adjusting to door thicknesses of 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches. Plus it is available in either a 2-3/8 inch backset or a 2-3/4 inch backset.",
